{"id":"d4b1b39ab449a633","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-abstract-rosser-incompleteness.md","title":"Abstract Rosser Incompleteness from One Fixed Point","display":"thm-abstract-rosser-incompleteness — Abstract Rosser Incompleteness from One Fixed Point","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-abstract-rosser-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-abstract-rosser-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-abstract-rosser-incompleteness — Abstract Rosser Incompleteness from One Fixed Point","source":"第 XI 章 p. 127，Theorem 3（PDF 144）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-abstract-rosser-mapping]]","[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-abstract-rosser-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-abstract-rosser-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-abstract-rosser-incompleteness — Abstract Rosser Incompleteness from One Fixed Point"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 127，Theorem 3（PDF 144）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04668803c3c70a0e\" href=\"?note=04668803c3c70a0e\" title=\"92-df-abstract-rosser-mapping\">92-df-abstract-rosser-mapping</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd433626d0825ffc\" href=\"?note=bd433626d0825ffc\" title=\"92-df-normal-stable-system\">92-df-normal-stable-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type1}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Type1}(M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q:S\\to S\">\\(Q:S\\to S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RosserMap}_M(Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{RosserMap}_M(Q)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in S\">\\(\\rho\\in S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\rho\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_MQ\\rho)\\in P\">\\((\\rho\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_MQ\\rho)\\in P\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\rho\\notin P\\land\\neg_M\\rho\\notin P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\rho\\notin P\\land\\neg_M\\rho\\notin P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in P\">\\(\\rho\\in P\\)</span>，RosserMap 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\rho\\in P\">\\(Q\\rho\\in P\\)</span>，固定点给出其否定可证，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in P\">\\(f\\in P\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_M\\rho\\in P\">\\(\\neg_M\\rho\\in P\\)</span>，RosserMap 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_MQ\\rho\\in P\">\\(\\neg_MQ\\rho\\in P\\)</span>，固定点再给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in P\">\\(\\rho\\in P\\)</span>，仍不相容。</p>\n<p>两个方向都只用普通相容性与 Type 1，不依赖 Normal、Stable 或 HBL。负固定点和 Rosser 映射各自是明确前提，名称本身不保证其存在。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 XI 章 p. 127，Theorem 3（PDF 144）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","tex